      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: I've seen Robert Routon's post which has 79 votes. I haven't noticed any under review or in progress. I don't understand why these ideas don't have more votes when they'd clearly boost performance. I assume people think the current \"show avatar\" button is good enough when it's actually not... Unless you like getting crashed in public worlds.",
