      "value": "@{60532490042ee7509d6d73ba|full_name}: Yup here is the current list. Took me ages to find where I put it:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/being-able-to-change-safety-avatar-options-to-specific-users\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/adjust-safety-settings-for-individuals\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/safety-settings\nDear canny moderators, can you please merge the posts so I don't have to scroll through a million canny posts to find these, thank you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
