      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: This post in particular is a bit different from those three, but I can definitely merge those three.\nWe're well aware of this particular request (and in fact had the idea way back when we implemented Safety the first time around), but there are design, usability, and implementation concerns. We've decided to put it aside for the moment.\nAs a side-note, something being highly requested does not mean it is guaranteed implementation, but it does have a heavy influence on the decision.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
