      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Yup similar for sure but I see why this one is separate. \nKeep in mind when implementing features that not everything has to be fancy. Give us an advanced section in a menu with a warning popup if you have to. Or have menu items hidden unless a configuration option is in the text file. Just don’t leave things like the show avatar button as the only thing for years that will kill performance and defeats the whole point of the safety settings when used.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
